    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***FINAL 2 BED APARTMENTS FOR SALE***\n\nKEY SELLING POINTS:\n\n- All Apartments Are Ready To Move Into\n- Flooring is included\n- A Rated\n\nContact us on ph: 016671888 to arrange a viewing.\n\nThe Apartments at Coach Road Meadows in Clane Co Kildare will consist of 48 x 2 bed apartments and 4 x 1 Bed apartments.\n\nRegister NOW on www.coachroadmeadows.ie\n\nThese elegant and very spacious homes are within walking distance of Clane Main Street which hosts a wide variety of amenities at your door step. \n\nA wide variety of features such as high levels of insulation in the walls, floors and roof highly efficient, thermostatically controlled radiators and high performance windows combine to ensure lower energy usage and higher levels of luxury. All of the homes in Coach Road Meadows will enjoy a BER A-rating.\n\nCoach Road Meadows is being developed by Killross Properties, a McKenna company. The McKenna's have decades of experience, proudly delivering superior quality homes in excellent locations which stand the test of time.\n\nPlease register your interest at www.coachroadmeadows.ie\n\nJoint agents:\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly \nTel:045868412\n\nSherry FitzGerald New Homes \nTel: 01 6671888\n\nBER A2\n\nDisclaimer: Please note the photos are for a similar type property in a different development by Killross Properties and should be used as reference only"
